OL,3,GNEWSAUniversity's licence to sponsor
OL,4,Astudents suspended
OL,5,
OL,6,FA university said it was working with
OL,7,Fthe government after its permission to
OL,8,Fsponsor international students' visas
OL,9,Fwas suspended.
OL,11,FBuckinghamshire New University's (BNU)
OL,12,Fstudent sponsor licence was suspended
OL,13,Fwith immediate effect on Wednesday, and
OL,14,Fthe university was removed from the
OL,15,Fsponsor register.
OL,17,FThe High Wycombe-based institution said
OL,18,F"many of the issues raised by the Home
OL,19,FOffice relate to historic international
OL,20,Fstudent recruitment activity".
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
