OL,3,GNEWSAUniversity's licence to sponsor
OL,4,Astudents suspended
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe university has been given 20
OL,7,Fworking days to respond, and its
OL,8,Flicence will be revoked if it cannot
OL,9,Fshow why it should be reinstated. The
OL,10,FHome Office's published guidance does
OL,11,Fnot explain why the suspension
OL,12,Foccurred.
